{"id":"verno","lemma":"верно","pos":"adv","rank":184,"glosses":["right, correctly","truly","faithfully, loyally, devotedly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/75/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Верно?","en":"Is that right?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/197023","words":[null]},{"text":"Я твой друг, верно?","en":"I am your friend, right?","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"close friend"},null]},{"text":"Это же так работает, верно?","en":"That's how it works, right?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264713","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"(emphasis)"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"},null]},{"text":"Ты всегда должен делать, что верно.","en":"You must always do what is right.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"what / that"},null]},{"text":"Абсолютно верно.","en":"That's absolutely right.","words":[{"g":"absolutely"},null]}]}